Description: kde-stereo-content-v1: the text KWin and stereo-declare carry
 .
 KWin's copy of the protocol (src/wayland/protocols/stereo) and
 libstereo-declare's protocol/ are now one file; this branch had the same
 version 2 with other line breaks and "The values match" for the one value
 of the content enum. Take that text, so the three copies are equal byte
 for byte. No wire change.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: https://invent.kde.org/danielcamposramos/plasma-wayland-protocols/-/commit/2ee5d4144223753017c6f2202578465e0301da28
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-22
Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 src/protocols/kde-stereo-content-v1.xml | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/protocols/kde-stereo-content-v1.xml b/src/protocols/kde-stereo-content-v1.xml
index 8ff2c11..a8f3675 100644
--- a/src/protocols/kde-stereo-content-v1.xml
+++ b/src/protocols/kde-stereo-content-v1.xml
@@ -9,9 +9,9 @@
 <interface name="kde_stereo_content_manager_v1" version="2">
   <description summary="declare stereo content of surfaces">
     A program tells the compositor that a surface's picture holds two
-    views, one per eye, packed full side by side, with the left eye
-    first. The compositor renders the declared surface once per eye
-    with that eye's view. The global being present announces support.
+    views, one per eye, packed full side by side, with the left eye first.
+    The compositor renders the declared surface once per eye with that
+    eye's view. The global being present announces support.
 
     Clients may use this protocol to declare stereo content. The version 1
     wire values are stable; future requests must use a new interface version.
@@ -65,7 +65,7 @@
 
   <enum name="content">
     <description summary="full side-by-side packing of the two views">
-      The values match the X11 property _KDE_NET_WM_STEREO_CONTENT.
+      The value matches the X11 property _KDE_NET_WM_STEREO_CONTENT.
     </description>
     <entry name="none" value="0" summary="no stereo content"/>
     <entry name="side_by_side_full" value="3" summary="side by side, full width per eye, left first"/>
